<title>FRANCE: Axa-UAP to cut stake in Elf, BNP - paper.</title>
<headline>Axa-UAP to cut stake in Elf, BNP - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer Axa-UAP plans to reduce its stake in Elf Aquitaine and Banque Nationale de Paris as part of an asset sale programme, business daily Les Echos said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said UAP's share portfolio had gained around 10 billion francs due to the recent rise in French stock prices, a gain which Axa-UAP planned to cash in on by pursuing the asset sale programme begun in January.</p>
</text>
